	quests: [
		{
			dependencies: ["51B9A72C19F84F0E"]
			description: [
				"The last three parts can also be used as covers"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"An Electric Motor is a device that converts electrical energy into mechanical energy. Its working principle is based on electromagnetic induction: when current flows through the motor's coils, a force is generated within the magnetic field, and this force makes the motor's rotor spin, thereby driving the load. Electric motors are widely used in all kinds of industrial, commercial and household appliances."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"An Electric Piston is an electrically driven reciprocating device that can convert the rotary motion of a motor into linear reciprocating motion. Such a device can be used in all sorts of applications, such as compressors, pneumatic actuators and robot arms."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"A Robot Arm is a mechanical device that mimics the function of a human arm. It usually consists of a series of links and joints and is capable of a range of complex movements, including rotation, bending and extension. Robot arms can carry out all kinds of tasks through programming or remote control, such as hauling, assembling, welding, spraying, measuring and exploring."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"A Conveyor is a transport machine used to carry materials or products from one place to another. It consists of one or more continuous belt structures rotating around two rollers, which serve as the drive and support points. Conveyors can run horizontally, or at an incline, or vertically, to suit different hauling needs."
			]
			id: "2D6BB32B642AE8BA"
			rewards: [{
				id: "544735BB21DE9B9D"
				item: "gtceu:silver_credit"
				type: "item"
