				""
				"Unless you really know what you are doing, it is recommended to &cdelete all byproducts from the pattern&r, to avoid byproducts taking part in crafting and jamming the craft"
				""
				"Because of various strange NBT issues, before you build the Molecular Assembler Matrix, avoid writing crafting patterns that contain GT tools or armour directly, and use tool-free processing patterns instead (see the Molecular Assembler guide page for details; put the tools directly into the Molecular Assembler as catalysts)"
