				""
				"The wireless grid mode can &6bypass the Dynamo Hatch&r"
				"{ \"text\": \"Feed energy directly into the wireless grid\", \"italic\":\"true\",\"underlined\":\"true\",\"color\":\"ff00ff\",\"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"1D4874CA93B567A3\" } }"
				""
				"In wireless grid mode it is recommended that the Dynamo Hatch's capacity be at least the base power of one generator, and that there be a way to automatically consume the power buffered in the Dynamo Hatch, so that the Generator Array does not shut down because the Dynamo Hatch's power buffer is full"
